@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title SEQ-20 - QUẢN TRỊ ĐƠN HÀNG & BÁN HÀNG
actor "Quản trị viên" as A
boundary "Admin Sales UI" as UI
control "Admin Orders API" as API
control "Sales Admin Service" as S
control "Prisma Client" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
A -> UI : Mở quản lý bán hàng
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/orders
API -> S : requireAdmin() + loadOrders()
S -> P : find Orders + Items
P -> DB : SELECT Order/OrderItem
S --> API : orders
API --> UI : danh sách
A -> UI : Cập nhật trạng thái/vận chuyển/thanh toán
UI -> API : PATCH /api/orders/:id
API -> S : validateAdminUpdate()
S -> P : update Order
P -> DB : UPDATE Order
S --> API : saved
API --> UI : refreshed order
A -> UI : Xem khách hàng/coupon/thống kê
UI -> API : GET admin business data
API -> S : loadSalesData()
S -> P : aggregate business data
P -> DB : SELECT User/Coupon/Order
S --> API : sales data
API --> UI : hiển thị
@enduml
